      "mediaType": "text/markdown",
      "summary": "The revised design keeps the full Production route as default and adds an explicit build-to-verify recovery route using four new fields, validation-owned full without-it evidence, risk-triggered review, and Captain-controlled fallback. The first slice is limited to 9 files with no new state, CI job, executable, UAT, auto-merge, or release authority."
